{"id":"n9992044b60","headline":"Karnataka’s IT exports may cross Rs 6 lakh cr this fiscal: Kharge","summary":"Karnataka's IT exports could cross Rs 6 lakh crore this fiscal, up from over Rs 5.5 lakh crore in 2025-26. Minister Priyank Kharge made the remarks ahead of Bengaluru Tech Summit 2026.","why":"Karnataka, centred on Bengaluru, is India's largest IT export hub, so its export trends signal the health of India's technology services sector.","category":"economy","event_type":"macro-data","importance":1,"flag":null,"market_moving":false,"location":{"place":"Bengaluru","country":"India","lat":12.97,"lon":77.59,"region":"asia"},"entities":[],"links":[],"source":{"name":"The Times of India","url":"https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/business/india-business/karnatakas-it-exports-may-cross-rs-6-lakh-cr-this-fiscal-kharge/articleshow/135892291.cms"},"sources":[{"name":"The Times of India","url":"https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/business/india-business/karnatakas-it-exports-may-cross-rs-6-lakh-cr-this-fiscal-kharge/articleshow/135892291.cms"}],"published_at":"2026-11-16T14:24:00Z","retrieved_at":"2026-11-16T16:00:23Z","official":false,"ai_summary":true,"content_hash":"deea683216a32cb3","impacts":[],"why_moved":null,"backfilled":true,"backfilled_at":"2026-11-16T16:00:23Z","backfill_provenance":{"version":"gdelt-backfill-v1","original_published_at":"2026-11-16T14:24:00Z","feed_url":"https://data.gdeltproject.org/gdeltv2/","discovered_via":"GDELT GKG 2.1","gdelt_seen":"2026-11-16T15:00:00Z","publisher_country_gdelt":"IN","description_from":"publisher page metadata"},"image":{"kind":"topic","file":"photos/data-center-servers-7014547.jpg","alt":"data center servers (illustration)","credit":"Tho-Ge","license":"Pixabay Content License","license_url":"https://pixabay.com/service/license-summary/","source":"Pixabay","source_url":"https://pixabay.com/photos/server-technology-computer-7014547/"}}